        <configuration inuse="true" name="r_sci_rx">
            <component description="依存モジュール: r_bsp バージョン 7.70&#10;依存モジュール: r_byteq バージョン 2.20&#10;This module allows any number of SCI channels on the MCU to run in full duplex Asynchronous mode, single master Simple SPI mode, or master Synchronous mode simultaneously. The driver is interrupt driven and non-blocking. Transmit and receive buffer queues are used in Asynchronous mode and their sizes may be configured independently for each channel. Resources for unused channels or modes may be removed via settings in the driver's config.h file." detailDescription="SCI Driver" display="r_sci_rx" id="r_sci_rx5.60" version="5.60">
