        <configuration inuse="true" name="r_dtc_rx">
            <component description="依存モジュール: r_bsp バージョン 7.70&#10;This driver gives the user an easy API to control the MCU's DTC. DTC module transfers the data corresponding to an interrupt when it signals to DTC. Each module can register its transfer settings with DTC driver such as: interrupt number, destination and source address, data counter, transfer mode (3 modes: normal, repeat, block), enable or disable chain transfer." detailDescription="DTC driver" display="r_dtc_rx" id="r_dtc_rx4.60" version="4.60">
